  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Batch",
      "items": [
        "Spark cleans two fiscal years of USAspending CSV into Parquet and drops awards to individuals; Deequ checks 11 constraints",
        "Gold conforms rows into events in arrival order and mixes in 225 labeled anomalies of nine types",
        "The same replay stream also fills an Iceberg lake, where DuckDB re-runs the reconciliation rules as SQL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ledger",
      "items": [
        "Append is idempotent: a twin delivered twice is refused",
        "The checkpointer hashes new leaves into an RFC 9162 log, signs the root, and writes the checkpoint back to the ledger",
        "Projections derive a double-entry journal and reconciliation breaks; the outbox relay publishes both to Redpanda for the WebSocket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust",
      "items": [
        "Checkpoint hashes are anchored by OpenTimestamps; the browser fetches the witnessed checkpoint from a second origin",
        "The browser trusts one public key compiled into the page and that checkpoint, and recomputes everything else",
        "The model never writes a number: it fills a typed query spec, and the verifier rejects any digit that is not bound to a slot"
      ]
    }
  ]
}